    <detaileddescription>
<para>A dynamics model that uses a pre-computed contribution profile (a time-indexed matrix of values) to compute the contribution to the state derivative via interpolation. This is useful for representing dynamics from pre-computed maneuver profiles or externally generated force models. </para>
